# Urban model: component sources, equations and evidence

28 October 2026. Feedback 12 restores the link/lane ledgers and per-lane mass grid to the main explanation, identifies component-level literature dependencies, cleans notation and connects the full sensitivity path. The core traffic laws and geometry remain the feedback-11 model. New and rewritten passages are red in both PDFs. This is a mathematical report under review, not an implemented simulator or an empirical result.

